<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page qd-theme qd-reward"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="growth-header"><image class="growth-header-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/badges.png"/><view class="growth-heading-copy"><view class="growth-title">你的坚持，有被看见</view><view class="growth-subtitle">已经点亮 {{litCount}} 枚成长勋章</view><view class="growth-subtitle">每一个小习惯，都是给自己的礼物。</view></view></view><view class="growth-grid"><view wx:for="{{milestones}}" wx:key="id" class="growth-card {{item.unlocked ? 'is-lit' : 'is-locked'}}"><image class="growth-art" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="growth-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="growth-rule">{{item.unlocked ? '已点亮' : '待解锁'}} · {{item.rule}}</view></view></view><button class="growth-share" data-url="/pages/share/index" bindtap="go">分享我的坚持</button><view class="growth-note">勋章奖励持续记录，不奖励极端饮食或快速掉秤。</view><view class="growth-existing-title">我的轻动徽章</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">开启我的轻动旅程</button></view><view wx:else class="grid2 section"><view wx:for="{{badges}}" wx:key="id" class="card badge-card {{item.unlocked?'':'locked-badge'}}"><view class="badge-symbol">{{item.unlocked?'✦':'◇'}}</view><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><text class="caption">{{item.description}}</text><text class="pill mt">{{item.unlocked?'已点亮':item.value+' / '+item.target}}</text></view></view><button class="btn soft section entry-home" data-url="/pages/index/index" bindtap="go">继续今天的小坚持 ↗</button></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
